steps.bodyEn:
Inside a `BEGIN TRY ... BEGIN TRANSACTION` block, check each rule and `THROW 50001, N'Section is full.', 1;` when it fails:
- the section exists and is not full;
- the student is not already enrolled;
- the prerequisite is passed;
- no other section of the student in the same term overlaps in day and time.

In CATCH, roll back if `@@TRANCOUNT > 0` and re-throw with `THROW;`.
